00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:37.080
The two tower mixture of Transformers design runs an auto regressive vision language model

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:42.920
reasoner in one tower while a diffusion generator sits in the second. During inference,

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:48.780
the reasoner proposes actions or world states and the diffusion tower renders them into executable

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:53.700
outputs or simulated environments without requiring a separate control policy network.

00:06:54.260 --> 00:07:00.200
That removes one layer of handoff latency and lets the model train end to end on trajectories that

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:06.300
